t vicious zombies and learn how to efficiently dispatch each variation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">4-player Mayhem!</h2><br>Same screen local co-op to ease the pain! Or does it?!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Stocked Shop!</h2><br>Power yourself every step of the way! Purchase new and unique weapons, buffs, barricades, turrets and more during  the heat of the fight!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bop your head while you explode those zeds!</h2><br>Enjoy killing the endless onslaught to a retro-style sound track!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806050/extras/bd27f0b191b1bd4d3377f2886ff4218d.poster.avif?t=1740758367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806050/extras/bd27f0b191b1bd4d3377f2886ff4218d.webm?t=1740758367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1806050/extras/bd27f0b191b1bd4d3377f2886ff4218d.mp4?t=1740758367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
